7AFFF][/#87AFFF]by_status_panels_and_stale_tui.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/by_status_panels_and_stale_tui.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-12p[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-12p/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Admit BY_STATUS grouping to the incremental Agents display [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]path[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]by-status-incremental[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]by-status-incremental: determine the BY_STATUS panel-safety invariants, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]allow the incremental display diff and row remove paths when the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rendered widget tree and status-bucket membership are stable, retain a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]full rebuild (under a distinct fallback reason) for genuine bucket, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hierarchy, or anchor changes, and cover both directions with focused and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]perf tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Detect and surface a running TUI whose editable checkout has [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]advanced[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]stale-process-restart[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]stale-process-restart: record the editable checkouts' imported git [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]revisions at TUI startup, cheaply revalidate them on the existing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]update-status cadence, and when the deployed checkout has advanced past [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the running process surface a restart-to-load-new-code state in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Update panel and notifications wired to the existing restart-when-ready [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]machinery, without adding render-path or keystroke cost.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]On-host verification of panel stability and stale-code [/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]surfacing[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]verify-on-athena[dim] · [dim][/dim]after by-status-incremental, stale-process-restart[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify-on-athena: restart the athena TUI onto the fixed tree, soak under[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]BY_STATUS grouping with live churn proving `@epic` stays mounted with no[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]steady-state unsupported_grouping fallbacks, script a checkout-advance [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]to prove the staleness indicator fires and clears through a restart, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]add a regression guard against silent full-rebuild reintroduction.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-12p","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-12p.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-60c48aa96240940e42f09a23b66c1dcb","started_at":"2026-09-18T11:04:40.543229+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"f7c3e07b14d94cba76bd3b0e683e5d44cd388b6fff42534bbbf8ce8916952e47","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-12p.3--plan/chat.md","size_bytes":5607},"commits":{"digest":"654085495870d572bfdd0b1ad778245533731b5e1c3f9ef60f7761f437285357","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-12p.3--plan/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-12p.3--plan/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"c50af69a2260b7f4f4607fac0648b6b08920311abf74eaed4c3259a67db0d253","path":"agents/bbugyi200.at